You're at it for about five minutes.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.060
And then that sensation hits you

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.620
where you really wanna quit.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:34.020
Like it's becoming super boring.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.200
It's becoming unbearable.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:37.070
You're starting to lose focus.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.460
So then you quit, and
you go do something else,

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:40.700
as if five minutes was enough

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.350
to do any sort of meaningful work.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.160
But that's because you didn't push through

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.550
the concentration hump.

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:47.660
If you're able to stick with an activity

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.270
past the 20-minute mark,

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.830
then you'll enter the flow state

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.910
in which doing that
activity is way easier.

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:55.520
You've probably had a crazy deadline

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:58.650
that you like, the fear
of God is put into you,

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:00.350
and you really just have
to sit down and do it,

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.110
regardless if you enjoy it or not.

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:04.560
You've probably found that
once you sit down to do it,

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.940
it's kind of hard at first,

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:07.990
but after about 20 minutes of doing it,

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:10.010
you start to get into
a flow and then like,

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:11.179
things are happening around you.

00:11:11.179 --> 00:11:12.670
Someone knocks on your door,

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:14.280
and you're like, don't like don't.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:17.030
It's almost like you're
so into doing that thing,

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.910
that nothing else in the world matters.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.970
You've entered the 11th dimension.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:23.650
And all you have is that
thing in front of you.

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:24.620
That's the flow state.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.700
If you can make it past
the 20-minute mark,

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:27.950
you can enter the flow state.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:31.330
So tip number four, is be
aware of the flow state.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.810
Try to stick with it, uninterrupted,

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:35.300
for more than 20 minutes.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.410
And I guarantee you
you'll enter a flow state,

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.670
assuming that you have
notifications turned off,

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.620
which will just completely
ruin the whole thing.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:44.270
And you'll find that your
most impactful creative work

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:47.550
will be able to be accomplished
with that hyper-focus,

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:49.340
that people seem to lack these days.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:50.420
You'll be a superpower.

